[
    {
        "text": "\u7b2c\u4e8c\u5341\u516b\u5173\uff08\u540e\uff09",
        "tag": "header",
        "key": "title_test",
        "is_skippable": true,
        "fit_mode": "BLACK_MASK"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "image": "bg_wild_a",
        "width": 1,
        "height": 1,
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$loading_intro",
        "key": "$loading_loop",
        "volume": 0.8,
        "crossfade": 1.5,
        "delay": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_2"
    },
    {
        "text": "No...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "Impossible! Impossible...!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "H-how could this be?! Skullshatterer, Skullshatterer!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "W-we can't let Misha see this...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who here knows first aid? Get them over here now!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "Damn it, why did Mephisto refuse to come? What is he doing?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "He kept talking about some 'other plan'... What the hell is with that?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "If he was here, we would've been able to save so many people!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": ""
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1504_cqbw",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "We can't count on that guy anyway. He doesn't care about his comrades anyway.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1504_cqbw",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1504_cqbw",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't blame yourself for things you can't control.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1504_cqbw",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Thanks for covering us, W...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "At least, we were able to bring him back.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1504_cqbw",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "If you want to thank me, do it through your actions.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1504_cqbw",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course. We'll cover your escape... However, I have one request--",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "Please promise to take care of Misha.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1504_cqbw",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course. After all...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_012_misa_1#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "I am still of use to you, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_2"
    },
    {
        "text": "We...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_012_misa_1",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Please let me spend some time with Skullshatterer alone.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "text": "I will... take care of him.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_012_misa_1",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "But...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "... ...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Fine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "W, it's a promise. One that you must keep.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1504_cqbw",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I know, I know~",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog",
        "fadetime": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_012_misa_1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.6
    },
    {
        "text": "I just said--",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let me spend some time with him alone.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1504_cqbw"
    },
    {
        "text": "But you should get going.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_012_misa_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_012_misa_1",
        "name2": "char_1504_cqbw",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Lungmen and Rhodes Island will come barging in here any moment now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "I guess the people here are going to die too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "My, oh my, what a dilemma we have.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "Misha, so many more people are going to die because of you...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "What a pity.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_012_misa_1",
        "name2": "char_1504_cqbw",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You're really getting on my nerves, W.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "text": "You won't get anything from me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_012_misa_1",
        "name2": "char_1504_cqbw",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Wooahh, scary~",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "You know, that bunny girl seems to really care about you~",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "But, that Ch'en lady seems different.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "She won't show mercy to anyone.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "Maybe she'll decide to spare your life, because she needs you...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "But you've seen enough in Ursus to know what will happen after that, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_012_misa_1",
        "name2": "char_1504_cqbw",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_012_misa_1",
        "name2": "char_1504_cqbw",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "If you come with me now, it's still not too late.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "Although... you'd still have to watch all our Reunion friends sacrifice themselves...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "I suppose that's just their fate though.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "Such pitiful things.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_012_misa_1",
        "name2": "char_1504_cqbw",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_012_misa_1",
        "name2": "char_1504_cqbw",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah, that's right.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even though you saw everything that happened...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "Y'know, ahh, how do I put this... I really don't have the spare energy to drag Skullshatterer back to Chernobog...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_012_misa_1",
        "name2": "char_1504_cqbw",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Shut up!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_012_misa_1",
        "name2": "char_1504_cqbw",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm just telling the truth.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "I mean, the situation here is hopeless after all~",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hurry and let me know once you've cleared your head, okay?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
